        "slc_09dd69b938c86a02fbf241728dc08d090939df3a92697a08e0865bb54d42e42b"
      ],
      "text": "The /code agent runs a six-phase pipeline: Analyze, Fetch Context, Plan, Execute, Review, and Validate, ending with files updated on disk."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_d51c758a2fa42ddb1ac8ca5620779caf3aa72a2986e7391fb9c06e0006937ef9",
